message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "STUR Resistance Equation: Derivation Record"
abstract: >-
  Resistance is one loop phase, Phi_R, whose variance is entropy, whose
  energy cost is set by temperature, and whose ceiling is set by boundary
  area. One line is a STUR postulate, S_R = 1/2 k_B Phi_R^2; the rest is
  established physics or follows from it. Saturating the holographic ceiling
  at the Hawking temperature reproduces Smarr's relation Mc^2 = 2TS. Every
  number is reproduced by src/stur_verify.py.
